# treadle 1
type FilesMain class
	namespace Cx
	static
	doc "Core File (WriteAllText, Exists, ReadLines with both line breaks, ReadAllText, Delete) and Directory (Create with a missing parent, Exists, GetFiles, GetDirectories, Delete) in a kfiles folder under the working folder, removed again at the end."

